bug_report:
Cannot take address of template function
template<typename... Params>
    constexpr int Func(Params&&...)
    {
        return 0;
    }

    int main(void)
    {
        constexpr auto fp1 = &Func<int,double,float>;              // compiles
        constexpr auto fp2 = (nullptr, &Func<int,double,float>);   // doesn't compile
    }

The above program compiles without failure on LLVM clang, Microsoft Visual C++ and Intel ICX. But GNU g++ fail to compile it:

    <source>: In function 'int main()':
    <source>:10:36: error: no context to resolve type of '& Func<int, double, float>'
      10 |    constexpr auto fp2 = (nullptr, &Func<int,double,float>);  // doesn't compile
